   (normal consequence of restarting the dev server across agent sessions);
   no fix needed. `GET /health` itself is fine — it runs ~15 real
   Databricks/Lakebase probes serially and legitimately takes ~10-11s end to
   end, which just needs a longer client timeout than a quick smoke-check
   `curl -m 5` allows.
